Gaps / deliberately not claimed
Live Claude/Codex role-prompt and resume snapshot semantics, overlay merging/policy/trust, actual Codex child-hook events, messaging-socket auth/acceptance, active-turn queue behavior, idle subscription/model-consumption acknowledgement and native ULID-message acceptance are unexercised. Native fixtures validate our framing and evidence accounting, not harness compatibility certification.
Input arbiter supplies foreground/draft/termios/render facts. The positive-proof/negative-check contract and refusal are tested, not a real TUI check/write handshake or GUI/MCP input integration. The message layer must persist native outcomes before retry/restart; adapter memory is not that durable ledger.
